        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dancing with Shadows: Prologue</i> is the first installment of an episodic dark fantasy visual novel with CYOA-influenced branching storylines, romantic routes, and many different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide three protagonists through a storyline left for you to untangle. Your choices don't just shape the outcome of the story, they shape the personas of the protagonists you control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first installation in a four-part story offers a complete narrative arc and serves as the foundation for a larger story. This game is designed to be played multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic routes dynamically evolve across paths, with three (or perhaps four) potential love interests to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback and collaboration are welcome. Join us on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wrong answers, but every answer carries weight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dancing with Shadows: Prologue</i> features 3 different protagonists and 3 primary love interests. These stories play out in sequence, and the choices you make one one path affect the next in sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions made in <i>Dancing with Shadows: Prologue</i> effect the identity of the protagonist you control within the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story contains many branching paths, which are determined by the choices you make as the protagonist you control. These choices results in many different possible endings, some of which are carefully hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dialogue of<i> Dancing with Shadows: Prologue</i> contains 1,474 lines  and 14,403 words.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love Interests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras/9c18ffeedbf8c75e45cf257a589998ea.avif?t=1754558455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras_big/9c18ffeedbf8c75e45cf257a589998ea.avif?t=1754558455 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras/ef0198282f6987935646ff6a9d861e6c.avif?t=1754558455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras_big/ef0198282f6987935646ff6a9d861e6c.avif?t=1754558455 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras/d32d7871f5f50c03918404de39c8ee94.avif?t=1754558455\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras/b339314f4ed14ad3f19f29f5db8734bc.avif?t=1754558455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras_big/b339314f4ed14ad3f19f29f5db8734bc.avif?t=1754558455 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras/cf7908fded1a8f7c94a1c01d95a85151.avif?t=1754558455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859300/extras_big/cf7908fded1a8